#Linux

 >> t := Moment ri.
 
t zonë: ['Europe/Amsterdam'].
t vit: 2020, muaj: 8, ditë: 2, orë: 21, minutë: 2, sekondë: 1.

>> a := t orë.
>> ams := t zonë.

t zonë: ['US/Hawaii'].
>> b := t orë.
>> hw := t zonë.

Dalje
shkruaj: (
	['It's diff in zone2 than in zone1']
	zone1: ams,
	zone2: hw,
	diff: (
		(b > a)
		ose: ['later'] ose: ['earlier']
	)
),
rresht-ri.
 